  25: def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:
  26:     """Complete every same-colored frame with the union of that color's internal motif positions.
  27: 
  28:     Input structure
  29:     The grid is a rectangular array of equal-size colored frames separated by background rows and columns.
  30:     Each frame has a solid one-pixel border and may contain additional pixels of its own color inside.
  31: 
  32:     Rule
  33:     For each frame color, collect all relative positions occupied by that color across every frame of that
  34:     color, then repaint those positions into every frame with that color.
  35: 
  36:     Key insight
  37:     Repeated frame colors are duplicate motif carriers: incomplete copies are completed by sharing the
  38:     relative colored-cell mask within the color group.
